{"id":"5b05063e6c15465b","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable.md","title":"一般左c.e.实数上sw与Solovay不可比","display":"thm-sw-solovay-incomparable — 一般左c.e.实数上sw与Solovay不可比","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable","aliases":["43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable"],"display":"thm-sw-solovay-incomparable — 一般左c.e.实数上sw与Solovay不可比","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-df-sw-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorems 13.5.6–13.5.7","source_printed_pages":"354–355","source_pdf_pages":"374–375","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sw-solovay-incomparable — 一般左c.e.实数上sw与Solovay不可比"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 13.5.6–13.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"354–355"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"374–375"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\rm sw}\">\\(\\le_{\\rm sw}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8cae575293a2fb87\" href=\"?note=8cae575293a2fb87\" title=\"43-df-sw-red\">43-df-sw-red</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 由下式定义；实数上的sw比较在下式直接使用给出的展开序列，避免隐藏选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land v(X)\\not\\le_Sv(Y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land v(X)\\not\\le_Sv(Y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land v(X)\\le_Sv(Y)\\land X\\not\\le_{\\rm sw}Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land v(X)\\le_Sv(Y)\\land X\\not\\le_{\\rm sw}Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两组见证可以不同，量词不得误合并成同一对互相矛盾的见证。源书第二组还给出非wtt归约的加强，本项只保留两种归约不可比的核心结论。陈述与否定方向已核对，有限损伤构造未完整重验。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorems 13.5.6–13.5.7；印刷页354–355，PDF页374–375。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sw-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_S$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]。$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义；实数上的sw比较在下式直接使用给出的展开序列，避免隐藏选择。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_S$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]。$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义；实数上的sw比较在下式直接使用给出的展开序列，避免隐藏选择。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sw-red","status":"resolved","id":"8cae575293a2fb87","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_S$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]。$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义；实数上的sw比较在下式直接使用给出的展开序列，避免隐藏选择。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\rm sw}","display":false},{"tex":"v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"v(X)\\coloneqq\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-(n+1)}\\qquad(X\\in2^\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land v(X)\\not\\le_Sv(Y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(X))\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(v(Y))\\land v(X)\\le_Sv(Y)\\land X\\not\\le_{\\rm sw}Y).","display":true}],"bytes":1907,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-335","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-sw-solovay-incomparable]] — 一般左c.e.实数上sw与Solovay不可比"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92","a566c9610179ba40","8cae575293a2fb87"]}